  "id": "foster-home-licensing",
  "name": "Foster home licensing",
  "description": "For foster home licensing workers: license renewals every year, home inspections every 3 months, yearly fire inspections and well water tests, and training hours, with the late homes first. Pulse is a tracking aid, not your official record system.",
  "icon": "house",
  "group": "Human services",
